@startuml
!include ../_fragments/style.puml
!include ../_fragments/legend.puml
BP_STYLE()
BP_LEGEND()


title M3 — Онбординг инструмента/биржи


start
partition "Admin" {
:POST /api/onboarding {exchange, instrument, tf-mapping};
}
partition "OnboardingService" {
:Validate config & TF mapping;
if (Valid?) then (yes)
:Resolve canonical TFs;
else (no)
:400 Bad Request;
stop
endif
}
partition "DB" {
:UPSERT exchange;
:UPSERT instrument;
:UPSERT exchange_instrument;
:INSERT coverage(start=null,end=null);
}
partition "Scheduler" {
:Schedule initial history download (all TF);
}
stop


note right
Ключи: канонические таймфреймы; immutable *_params\n
через registry (M2); без триггеров.
end note
@enduml